## GEOIDs in data.census.gov Downloads

Downloaded datasets commonly include two location fields:

| GEO.ID | NAME |
|-----------|-----------|
| 0500000US10001 | Kent County, Delaware |
| 0500000US10003 | New Castle County, Delaware |
| 0500000US10005 | Sussex County, Delaware |

### GEO.ID Structure

Example:

```text
0500000US48201
